flowchart TD
    N["Business or Engineering Need"]
    D["Draft Prompt"]
    R["Prompt Review"]
    A["Approved Prompt"]
    C["Context Resolution"]
    P["Agent Planning"]
    I["Implementation"]
    V["Validation"]
    E["Evaluation"]
    H["Human Approval"]
    O["Accepted Output"]
    M["Metrics and Improvement Evidence"]

    N --> D
    D --> R
    R -->|Changes required| D
    R -->|Approved| A
    A --> C
    C --> P
    P -->|Required decisions and approvals resolved| I
    I --> V
    V -->|Failed| I
    V -->|Passed| E
    E --> H
    H -->|Rejected| I
    H -->|Approved| O
    O --> M
    M --> D
